# ============================================================
# ~/.config dotfiles gitignore
# Strategy: ignore app runtime data, track actual configs
# ============================================================

# ── Caches (universal) ──────────────────────────────────────
**/cache/
**/Cache/
**/.cache/
**/GPUCache/
**/DawnCache/
**/DawnGraphiteCache/
**/DawnWebGPUCache/
**/Code Cache/
**/Shared Dictionary/
**/*.count

# ── Electron/Chromium runtime data ──────────────────────────
**/Local Storage/
**/Session Storage/
**/IndexedDB/
**/Network Persistent State
**/TransportSecurity
**/Cookies
**/DIPS
**/Partitions/
**/Preferences
**/LOG
**/LOG.old

# ── Logs & locks ────────────────────────────────────────────
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/*.lock

# ── Nested git repos ────────────────────────────────────────
**/.git/

# ── Binary blobs ────────────────────────────────────────────
**/*.dll
**/*.node
**/*.count

# ── App data dirs (not configs) ─────────────────────────────
